# Development defaults for uv-managed xpool commands.
#
# Use this file by copying it to a local .env, editing local-only values, and
# exporting UV_ENV_FILE before running uv commands:
#
#   export UV_ENV_FILE=/path/to/xpool/.env
#   uv run xpool daemon --check
#
# Keep the real .env untracked.

XPOOL_CONFIG=configs/dev.local.toml

# Create an ignored configs/dev.local.toml for host-specific devices and model
# paths. Model ids such as deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V2-Lite-Chat resolve through
# [vendor].model_base_uri unless a model entry provides an explicit absolute
# path override.

# Uncomment only for native shim development tests. Production runtime dispatch
# goes through xpool.ops.ffn_shim(); its underlying native op is intentionally
# unimplemented until the real attention/FFN transport lands.
# XPOOL_DEBUG_SHIM_LOOPBACK_ENABLE=1
#
# Graph observer variables are normally injected by tests that need them. Set
# them manually only for ad hoc SGLang graph debugging.
# XPOOL_DEBUG_GRAPH_OBSERVER_ENABLE=1
# XPOOL_DEBUG_GRAPH_OBSERVER_OUTDIR=.xpool-cache/graph-observer

# SGLang loads xpool from the sglang.srt.plugins entry point group.
SGLANG_PLUGINS=xpool
